DTEND:20261125T010500Z
SUMMARY:Touch of Evil
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:A car-bomb murder blows the lid off police corruption in a pest
 ilent border town\, resulting in a three-ring circus of a film noir that f
 izzled on release\, but is now seen\, on its own seamy merits\, to rival C
 itizen Kane in filmmaking audacity. Using actor/writer/director Orson Well
 es's 58-page memo of suggested changes as a blueprint\, Touch of Evil has 
 been reconstructed to the 110-minute version originally envisioned by the 
 late director. Charlton Heston\, Janet Leigh and Marlene Dietrich also sta
 r.\nhttps://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/91a4dc25-0b3d-59
 9d-b44c-229c5947cc00\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
URL:https://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/91a4dc25-0b3d-599
 d-b44c-229c5947cc00
END:VEVENT
